1
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:08,940
=When the Lights Rise=
=Episode 25=

2
00:01:17,660 --> 00:01:19,500
Sir, we're here.

3
00:01:23,340 --> 00:01:24,700
How are we supposed to get aboard?

4
00:01:53,140 --> 00:01:54,420
Please wait here for us.

5
00:01:54,420 --> 00:01:55,620
We'll leave as soon
as we've picked her up.

6
00:02:12,420 --> 00:02:13,660
Let's split up.

7
00:02:13,660 --> 00:02:14,900
Once we find Mei Yuhe, we leave.

8
00:02:15,140 --> 00:02:15,940
Be careful.

9
00:02:36,820 --> 00:02:37,620
What are you doing?

10
00:02:41,220 --> 00:02:42,660
You only need to check
her handbag, don't you?

11
00:02:48,980 --> 00:02:50,860
Miss Mei.

12
00:02:51,730 --> 00:02:53,300
You've finally arrived.

13
00:02:53,340 --> 00:02:54,140
Mr. Yoshida.

14
00:02:58,460 --> 00:03:01,660
Thanks to Mr. Jing's
careful arrangements,

15
00:03:01,820 --> 00:03:03,660
I have the pleasure
of seeing you again, Miss Mei.

16
00:03:03,780 --> 00:03:05,380
I'm delighted.

17
00:03:05,420 --> 00:03:07,380
We're the ones who should
thank you, Mr. Yoshida.

18
00:03:07,620 --> 00:03:08,500
Your willingness

19
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:10,460
to attend our cruise dinner

20
00:03:10,540 --> 00:03:12,060
is a great honor for Kun Society.

21
00:03:12,140 --> 00:03:13,240
You're too kind.

22
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:15,780
You've always taken
such good care of me.

23
00:03:15,780 --> 00:03:17,500
How could I refuse?

24
00:03:18,060 --> 00:03:22,460
Then I'll leave you two
to enjoy your conversation.

25
00:03:22,540 --> 00:03:23,900
Excuse me.

26
00:03:25,420 --> 00:03:26,740
Please come in, Miss Mei.

27
00:03:30,380 --> 00:03:31,260
Do come in.

28
00:03:59,500 --> 00:04:00,300
Miss Mei.

29
00:04:00,620 --> 00:04:03,020
I've always greatly admired

30
00:04:03,020 --> 00:04:04,540
your courage and talents.

31
00:04:04,820 --> 00:04:05,900
And I've long looked forward

32
00:04:05,900 --> 00:04:07,980
to having a proper
conversation with you.

33
00:04:08,220 --> 00:04:09,260
You're too kind.

34
00:04:19,620 --> 00:04:20,820
Don't be afraid, Miss Mei.

35
00:04:20,820 --> 00:04:22,500
Those are just fireworks outside.

36
00:04:40,540 --> 00:04:42,340
Something's wrong!

37
00:04:50,820 --> 00:04:52,660
Sir, the ship is about
to head out to sea.

38
00:04:52,900 --> 00:04:53,700
Begin.

39
00:04:54,260 --> 00:04:55,220
What are you doing?

40
00:04:58,300 --> 00:04:59,100
Miss Mei.

41
00:04:59,220 --> 00:05:00,420
No matter what you hear outside,

42
00:05:00,420 --> 00:05:01,140
don't make a sound.

43
00:05:01,140 --> 00:05:02,020
Wait here for me.

44
00:05:02,860 --> 00:05:03,660
What do you mean?

45
00:05:04,180 --> 00:05:05,260
Jing Fanshu!

46
00:05:05,500 --> 00:05:06,620
- I have something else to take care of.
- What are you doing?

47
00:05:06,620 --> 00:05:07,580
Wait here for me.

48
00:05:08,220 --> 00:05:09,020
Jing Fanshu!

49
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:44,170
- Enjoy your drinks, everyone.
- Detective Inspector, you must

50
00:05:44,170 --> 00:05:45,140
have a few more drinks today.

51
00:05:46,700 --> 00:05:48,380
Come on, let's go over here.

52
00:05:50,940 --> 00:05:51,860
- Director Kong.
- Come on, cheers.

53
00:05:51,860 --> 00:05:52,820
Detective Inspector Jiang.

54
00:05:54,900 --> 00:05:56,100
Those cats...

55
00:05:57,020 --> 00:05:58,340
What's the hurry?

56
00:05:58,340 --> 00:06:00,140
The show has only just begun.

57
00:06:00,420 --> 00:06:02,900
The main attraction comes later.

58
00:06:10,380 --> 00:06:11,580
Have you seen Yoshida?

59
00:06:11,580 --> 00:06:13,060
I haven't seen him since we boarded.

60
00:06:13,140 --> 00:06:15,700
Could he be enjoying himself with a cat?

61
00:06:16,020 --> 00:06:16,900
Go check on him.

62
00:06:16,900 --> 00:06:17,620
Yes.

63
00:06:21,300 --> 00:06:23,180
Make sure Bank President Qin
is well looked after.

64
00:06:24,340 --> 00:06:25,340
I'll be back.

65
00:07:56,900 --> 00:07:57,430
Boss.

66
00:07:58,020 --> 00:07:58,900
Guard this place.

67
00:07:59,140 --> 00:08:00,220
Don't let anyone in.

68
00:08:00,220 --> 00:08:00,900
- Yes.
- Yes.

69
00:08:27,020 --> 00:08:28,020
What are you doing here?

70
00:08:28,140 --> 00:08:29,100
Who brought you here?

71
00:08:32,820 --> 00:08:33,620
Sit here.

72
00:08:35,020 --> 00:08:36,180
We met earlier today.

73
00:08:36,180 --> 00:08:37,060
Remember?

74
00:08:39,780 --> 00:08:41,140
Are the other children aboard too?

75
00:08:41,220 --> 00:08:42,500
Are they in other rooms?

76
00:08:48,140 --> 00:08:48,670
Come on.

77
00:08:49,020 --> 00:08:50,140
Let's play a game together,

78
00:08:50,140 --> 00:08:50,820
all right?

79
00:08:50,980 --> 00:08:52,220
Neither of us will make a sound.

80
00:08:52,820 --> 00:08:53,620
Shh.

81
00:08:53,980 --> 00:08:54,940
Shh.

82
00:08:57,940 --> 00:08:58,820
It's all right.

83
00:08:59,180 --> 00:08:59,940
Don't be afraid.

84
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:15,940
Come on.

85
00:09:15,940 --> 00:09:16,660
Let's play hide-and-seek,

86
00:09:16,660 --> 00:09:17,420
all right?

87
00:09:18,460 --> 00:09:19,380
Hide here.

88
00:09:20,620 --> 00:09:21,500
Careful.

89
00:09:22,860 --> 00:09:23,660
Stay hidden here.

90
00:09:23,660 --> 00:09:24,660
Whatever you do, don't go outside.

91
00:09:24,660 --> 00:09:25,980
I'll come back for you soon.

92
00:09:31,220 --> 00:09:32,860
It's all right. Don't be afraid.

93
00:09:33,020 --> 00:09:34,460
I promise I'll come back.

94
00:09:34,780 --> 00:09:36,580
Don't be afraid. Shh.

95
00:09:39,370 --> 00:09:40,110
Make sure you stay hidden.

96
00:09:40,380 --> 00:09:41,180
Don't go out.

97
00:09:55,540 --> 00:09:56,340
What's going on?

98
00:09:56,580 --> 00:09:58,020
Mr. Yoshida and his men
have been killed.

99
00:09:58,020 --> 00:09:58,980
The banquet hall is under attack.

100
00:09:58,980 --> 00:09:59,620
Go deal with it, quickly!

101
00:09:59,620 --> 00:10:00,300
Yes.

102
00:10:03,780 --> 00:10:05,380
Just lock everyone inside
the banquet hall.

103
00:10:05,620 --> 00:10:07,020
Don't get caught up
fighting Kun Society's men.

104
00:10:07,020 --> 00:10:07,940
Mr. Jing said

105
00:10:07,940 --> 00:10:08,660
killing Boss Ren

106
00:10:08,660 --> 00:10:09,660
is our top priority.

107
00:10:09,660 --> 00:10:10,140
Right.

108
00:10:10,400 --> 00:10:11,310
Jing Fanshu?

109
00:10:36,940 --> 00:10:37,780
(Jiang Menhu?)

110
00:10:45,980 --> 00:10:46,780
At a time like this,

111
00:10:46,780 --> 00:10:47,740
you're still here drinking?

112
00:10:47,940 --> 00:10:49,100
What's happening downstairs?

113
00:10:49,380 --> 00:10:50,460
Retribution has come.

114
00:10:50,730 --> 00:10:52,490
The punishment has only just begun.

115
00:11:21,740 --> 00:11:22,580
Long Feng.

116
00:11:22,820 --> 00:11:24,100
Long Feng, hang in there.

117
00:11:24,980 --> 00:11:26,180
I'll stop the bleeding.

118
00:11:36,940 --> 00:11:37,900
Where's Mei Yuhe?

119
00:11:45,020 --> 00:11:45,980
She couldn't bear...

120
00:11:46,420 --> 00:11:48,020
She couldn't bear being
violated by Yoshida.

121
00:11:48,540 --> 00:11:49,700
Maybe she jumped into the sea.

122
00:11:50,980 --> 00:11:52,060
Jiang Menhu.

123
00:11:53,020 --> 00:11:54,180
You'll pay for this.

124
00:12:00,540 --> 00:12:01,340
Hurry.

125
00:12:01,980 --> 00:12:03,420
Go save those children.

126
00:12:03,420 --> 00:12:04,420
What children?

127
00:12:04,780 --> 00:12:05,820
Bai Mali.

128
00:12:06,740 --> 00:12:07,620
You stay here.

129
00:12:07,620 --> 00:12:08,580
I'll go find Mei Yuhe.

130
00:12:08,580 --> 00:12:10,020
Long Feng said
there are children aboard.

131
00:12:10,020 --> 00:12:11,300
She asked us to save them.

132
00:12:13,020 --> 00:12:13,900
I understand.

133
00:12:18,620 --> 00:12:20,420
I've saved you every other time.

134
00:12:20,620 --> 00:12:22,180
I can save you this time too.

135
00:12:23,340 --> 00:12:24,140
Go.

136
00:12:25,140 --> 00:12:26,500
The ship is going to explode.

137
00:12:28,460 --> 00:12:31,900
Stay alive...

138
00:12:33,420 --> 00:12:34,660
Long Feng, don't fall asleep.

139
00:12:34,780 --> 00:12:35,300
Stay awake.

140
00:12:35,300 --> 00:12:36,620
Didn't you want to go back to Nanyang?

141
00:12:37,420 --> 00:12:38,540
Once we get off this ship,

142
00:12:38,620 --> 00:12:40,540
I can go to Nanyang with you.

143
00:12:43,220 --> 00:12:44,020
Long Feng.

144
00:12:45,580 --> 00:12:46,380
Nanyang...

145
00:12:48,660 --> 00:12:49,460
Long Feng.

146
00:12:57,620 --> 00:12:59,940
Throw me into the Huangpu River.

147
00:13:04,140 --> 00:13:07,220
I'll drift and drift.

148
00:13:09,460 --> 00:13:10,980
Eventually, I'll make it

149
00:13:13,780 --> 00:13:17,620
back to Nanyang.

150
00:13:40,580 --> 00:13:41,380
Shh.

151
00:14:11,700 --> 00:14:13,620
(Why are all the children
from the Cishan Foundation here?)

152
00:14:13,900 --> 00:14:14,980
(Didn't he say)

153
00:14:14,980 --> 00:14:16,780
(he refused Lv Mengde's offer?)

154
00:14:17,700 --> 00:14:18,660
(Or could it be...)

155
00:14:21,260 --> 00:14:22,060
(Miss Mei,)

156
00:14:22,420 --> 00:14:23,500
(if you die,)

157
00:14:23,700 --> 00:14:25,180
who will get justice for your sister?

158
00:14:25,780 --> 00:14:28,100
I hope you'll keep investigating

159
00:14:28,300 --> 00:14:29,380
this case until the end.

160
00:14:29,380 --> 00:14:30,525
(Give me back my daughter)
(I want to uncover the truth)

161
00:14:30,525 --> 00:14:31,860
(Give me back my daughter)
(behind what happened to these women.)

162
00:14:31,940 --> 00:14:33,420
(Who is really hurting them?)

163
00:14:33,420 --> 00:14:34,940
Will you help me investigate?

164
00:14:35,980 --> 00:14:37,020
(Once the list is exposed,)

165
00:14:37,020 --> 00:14:38,340
(it won't just reveal a small part.)

166
00:14:38,420 --> 00:14:39,860
(It'll expose everything.)

167
00:14:40,020 --> 00:14:40,820
I know.

168
00:14:40,900 --> 00:14:42,500
But I want everything exposed.

169
00:14:42,540 --> 00:14:43,660
We take different paths
toward the same goal.

170
00:14:43,980 --> 00:14:45,260
I'm begging you to help me.

171
00:14:45,780 --> 00:14:47,980
(You knew what he was doing all along.)

172
00:14:47,980 --> 00:14:49,500
I wanted us to fight
for justice together.

173
00:14:50,080 --> 00:14:50,820
(As long as the Japanese man)

174
00:14:50,820 --> 00:14:52,340
(dies on this cruise ship tonight,)

175
00:14:52,340 --> 00:14:53,380
(the bosses of Kun Society)

176
00:14:53,380 --> 00:14:55,180
(won't be able to
stay out of it anymore.)

177
00:14:55,620 --> 00:14:56,620
(As long as he dies,)

178
00:14:56,620 --> 00:14:58,820
those girls won't come to harm either.

179
00:15:52,820 --> 00:15:53,620
Sir.

180
00:15:56,580 --> 00:15:58,220
We've taken care of almost everything.

181
00:15:58,340 --> 00:15:59,780
Only this room is left.

182
00:15:59,780 --> 00:16:01,140
You can have the ship stopped now.

183
00:16:01,180 --> 00:16:01,980
Yes.

184
00:16:02,780 --> 00:16:05,100
Sir, watch out for a trap.

185
00:16:05,620 --> 00:16:06,460
Don't worry.

186
00:16:07,020 --> 00:16:08,020
Wait for me downstairs.

187
00:16:09,580 --> 00:16:10,380
Yes.

188
00:16:15,140 --> 00:16:15,940
Don't be afraid.

189
00:16:17,380 --> 00:16:19,020
We've come this far.

190
00:16:19,940 --> 00:16:21,460
We'll finally get
what we've been hoping for.

191
00:16:27,900 --> 00:16:28,700
Sir.

192
00:16:39,500 --> 00:16:40,300
Go ahead.

193
00:16:55,100 --> 00:16:55,900
Miss Mei.

194
00:16:56,380 --> 00:16:57,780
Didn't I tell you to stay in the room

195
00:16:57,820 --> 00:16:58,980
and not come out?

196
00:16:59,540 --> 00:17:00,740
Tell your men to leave.

197
00:17:01,100 --> 00:17:02,020
Close the door.

198
00:17:02,700 --> 00:17:03,820
I have something to ask you.

199
00:17:14,740 --> 00:17:15,820
What do you want to ask?

200
00:17:16,380 --> 00:17:17,700
Why did you lie to me?

201
00:17:18,780 --> 00:17:20,060
I saw everything.

202
00:17:20,300 --> 00:17:21,980
Every room on the third floor.

203
00:17:25,580 --> 00:17:27,100
I'd wondered before

204
00:17:27,580 --> 00:17:28,660
where Lv Mengde found

205
00:17:28,700 --> 00:17:30,420
so many girls

206
00:17:30,420 --> 00:17:33,380
and how he managed to tailor
stories for each one,

207
00:17:33,380 --> 00:17:34,140
appealing to their desires

208
00:17:34,140 --> 00:17:35,140
and luring them in.

209
00:17:35,980 --> 00:17:36,980
If

210
00:17:37,660 --> 00:17:39,660
Kaimeili was the girls' second stop,

211
00:17:40,220 --> 00:17:41,580
then where was the first?

212
00:17:41,740 --> 00:17:43,940
Who had access to
so many vulnerable girls

213
00:17:43,940 --> 00:17:45,700
desperate for money and affection?

214
00:17:45,820 --> 00:17:46,860
Only you.

215
00:17:46,900 --> 00:17:48,380
The great philanthropist Jing Fanshu.

216
00:17:50,300 --> 00:17:53,300
Kun Society organized tonight's banquet.

217
00:17:53,980 --> 00:17:55,380
The children brought aboard

218
00:17:55,900 --> 00:17:57,340
were also arranged by Kun Society.

219
00:17:57,340 --> 00:17:58,860
Without your secret planning,

220
00:17:59,180 --> 00:18:00,940
how could they have gotten hold
of so many children?

221
00:18:03,620 --> 00:18:05,100
If I hadn't planned all this,

222
00:18:05,420 --> 00:18:06,540
would those children

223
00:18:06,700 --> 00:18:09,100
have survived in Shanghai?

224
00:18:10,220 --> 00:18:11,700
So you admit it.

225
00:18:12,820 --> 00:18:15,300
You're the one behind
Long Feng and Lv Mengde.

226
00:18:15,780 --> 00:18:17,500
For the sake of
tonight's grand spectacle,

227
00:18:17,540 --> 00:18:18,940
how many lives have you taken?

228
00:18:18,940 --> 00:18:20,260
What are you really trying to achieve?

229
00:18:22,780 --> 00:18:25,540
♪And watch the lights
come on one by one♪

230
00:18:26,180 --> 00:18:29,180
♪Like blades cutting
through the radiance♪

231
00:18:29,820 --> 00:18:32,580
♪You may treat me as dust
beneath your feet♪

232
00:18:32,580 --> 00:18:34,540
♪Or wipe me away like ashes♪

233
00:18:34,540 --> 00:18:36,100
♪Leaving a cold ending♪

234
00:18:36,100 --> 00:18:38,060
♪But I refuse to fall♪

235
00:18:38,060 --> 00:18:43,100
♪I refuse to become a shadow
fading beneath the lights♪

236
00:18:43,100 --> 00:18:45,580
♪I refuse to dissolve into♪

237
00:18:46,620 --> 00:18:49,580
♪The lifeless light of the past♪

238
00:18:49,980 --> 00:18:52,860
♪I want sharpness at my fingertips♪

239
00:18:52,860 --> 00:18:55,780
♪And steps that avoid
the traps among the thorns♪

240
00:18:56,340 --> 00:18:59,220
♪At dawn, I will look
straight into your eyes♪

241
00:18:59,220 --> 00:19:02,620
♪My gaze clear, illuminating the dawn♪

242
00:19:03,900 --> 00:19:06,540
♪Those who have hurt me♪

243
00:19:07,180 --> 00:19:09,860
♪I choose to pierce through♪

244
00:19:11,540 --> 00:19:13,020
♪To tear apart♪

245
00:19:13,140 --> 00:19:19,100
♪To ignite a sacred flame♪

246
00:19:20,660 --> 00:19:22,660
♪I do not pray to the gods♪

247
00:19:22,660 --> 00:19:25,660
♪Nor bow to power♪

248
00:19:25,660 --> 00:19:28,100
♪I will no longer play the tragic lead♪

249
00:19:29,860 --> 00:19:33,540
♪I will stand and carve
the path of my own fate♪
